  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TA TVET - Jordan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme supports transforming the TVET system in Jordan to respond to labour market demands, youth unemployment and gender disparities. It will provide technical assistance to MoE in Jordan to implement of the Education Strategic Plan 2018-25 and the Ministry&apos;s TVET reforms. This will be done through three areas; Strengthening key institutional and policy elements of the national skills ecosystem for a better enabling institutional and policy environment; Enhancing skills development in priority sectors for young men and women through innovation in TVET; and Improving the perception of TVET to become a more attractive pathway for young girls and boys.</narrative>
  </description>
